====Batty Yatta====
During development of the {{HT|Halloween}} [[Skins]], a Batty Skin for {{CI|Yatta|name=true}} was scrapped. This Skin had Yatta in a red and black color palette, with the addition of black and red wings resembling bat wings and 2 fangs instead of her usual 3, likely to resemble vampire bats. Interestingly, her ruffled, frayed collar now has its fringes pointing up instead of down (which could've been a nod towards how most vampire capes have a collar pointing upwards). The idea of a vampire/bat like Skin was likely reused for the Sanguine Silence Skin for {{CI|Blot|name=true}}.
