====Alternate Render====
=====Cheer Bear Shelly=====
{{Skin|Cheer Bear|toon={{CI|Shelly|name=true}}}}'s unused render appears to use the same pose default Shelly's full render has. The differences between the used and unused renders include Cheer Bear Shelly facing the viewer in the used render while tilting her head instead of towards the left in the unused one, has her left leg positioned forwards with her right leg bent backwards instead of them both positioned to make it look like she is walking, and has her arms extended out to each side instead of on her chest. Why it was replaced is unknown, but one reason could be that the pose made her hands block the symbol on her dress. It is unknown if {{CI|Astro|name=true}} and {{CI|Shrimpo|name=true}} both had this situation too.
