{{Skin|Golden Bunny|toon={{CI|Cocoa|name=true}}}} and {{Skin|Golden Basket|toon={{CI|Bassie|name=true}}}}'s unused renders appear very different from their used renders, Cocoa's has her right leg bent and is looking to her right with her right arm bent in front of her, while Bassie's has her leg less bent, her right hand is placed in front of her, her left arm is beside her more, and she is looking up to the right. Their unused renders' poses they have their left legs bent back and their right hand on her cheek, and oddly enough Cocoa's has the same pose has her in-game Strawberry Paws render. The reason for this is unclear, but the unused renders may have simply been purely promotional material for the Roblox Event. Bassie's unused Golden Skin render was also the same as her default full render.
